# The official binary sets of NetBSD 11.1 for amd64, with the SHA512 of each from the SHA512 file
# of the release. scripts/netbsd/official.sh reads this file with the shell when
# NB_PIN_FILE=11.1.pin. rb foreign boots these sets on R's kernel (plan 12.8). The kernel sets are
# not here, because R's kernel takes their place, and the X and debug sets are not used.
